              "kind": "strong"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "kind": "action",
              "symbol": ":aa:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " (auditory, concentrate, death, occult) The banshee unleashes a soul-chilling "
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "wails of the damned"
                }
              ],
              "kind": "em"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " (DC 38). This Wail overcomes "
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "silence"
                }
              ],
              "kind": "em"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " and similar effects of 5th rank or lower. The banshee can instead use Wail as a three-action activity to overcome such effects of up to 8th rank."
            }
          ],
          "indent": "hanging",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "origin": {
            "startLine": 78,
            "endLine": 81,
            "startOffset": 3421,
            "endOffset": 3718
          }
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "The banshee’s Wail resonates for 1 round, and any creature that comes within the area during that time must attempt a save against the effect. A creature can’t be affected more than once by the same Wail. The banshee can’t Wail again for 1d4 rounds."
            }
          ],
