                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Unhealing Wound"
                }
              ],
              "kind": "strong"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " (curse, primal) A creature damaged by the barghest’s claws must succeed at a DC 21 Fortitude save or be cursed. The cursed creature can’t regain Hit Points except via magic until it returns to maximum Hit Points. The creature can attempt a new saving throw against the curse every 24 hours."
            }
